[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   The origin question (Section 6.8) turns on edge morphology: a
[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   topological-defect wall has a sharp threshold while a plasma-sourced
[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   gradient is diffuse.  The transition in the unexplained slip across the
[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   axis cap is fitted with a logistic edge
[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   dtau(theta) = A * sigmoid((theta0 - theta)/w) + c
[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   against the step-function alternative (w -> 0).  The 10-90% transition
[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   width 4.39w and its bootstrap interval quantify "sharp" in degrees of
[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   axis separation -- and, through the measured slip-vs-radius profile
[2026-09-21 14:49:13 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 073]   (step_071), in AU of boundary penetration.
